flowchart LR
  AL([Alert fires<br/>Prometheus → Alertmanager]) --> O[Incident opens itself<br/>deduplicated · correlated]
  O --> B[Investigate<br/>MCP tools: deploys, logs,<br/>metrics, runbooks]
  B --> C[Diagnose<br/>triage + ranked root causes<br/>with citations]
  C --> D[Guard<br/>validate citations,<br/>policy interlocks]
  D --> E{Human<br/>approval}
  E -->|approve| X[Execute once<br/>single-use capability<br/>via deploy adapter]
  X --> V{Verify<br/>real traffic}
  V -->|healthy| F[RESOLVED<br/>time to mitigate]
  V -->|not healthy| FF[REMEDIATION_FAILED<br/>back to a human]
  E -->|reject| G[Closed, no action]
  F & FF & G --> PM[Postmortem with timeline]
  K[(Team knowledge<br/>runbooks, postmortems)] -.grounds.-> B
  K -.grounds.-> Q[Ask: grounded answers<br/>with citations]
  classDef human fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#9a6200,color:#1d1d1b
  class E human
